  m_Name: LS_022_SOUVENIR
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocalizedStringSO
  en: "Do you remember those \u2018gifts\u2019 I mentioned? When customers leave\u2014especially
    the grumpy ones\u2014they\u2019ll leave you a souvenir of dirty items. Collect
    those gifts and get them over to the sink. I know, washing up isn't glamorous...
    but neither is serving espresso in a cup that smells like regret. Let\u2019s
    keep it sparkling, Can-Opener! </color><color=#FF9E3A> Bring dirty items to the
    sink </color>"
